<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Trust, Methodology & Independence | TechSelectAI</title><meta name="description" content="Learn how TechSelectAI evaluates software and technology, separates recommendation scoring from sponsorship, handles evidence, reviews, and Barmageyat-owned products."><link rel="canonical" href="https://techselectai.com/trust"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><meta property="og:title" content="Trust, Methodology & Independence | TechSelectAI"><meta property="og:description" content="See how TechSelectAI separates recommendation scoring from sponsorship and applies evidence standards to technology advice."><meta property="og:url" content="https://techselectai.com/trust"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"AboutPage","name":"TechSelectAI Trust, Methodology & Independence","url":"https://techselectai.com/trust","description":"How TechSelectAI evaluates technology, handles evidence, reviews, ownership disclosures and commercial relationships."}</script><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f7f9fc;color:#172033;line-height:1.65}.top{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:16px max(20px,5vw)}.top img{height:36px;width:auto}.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:42px 22px 64px}.hero{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dde7ee;border-radius:20px;padding:32px}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#319795}.hero h1{font-size:42px;line-height:1.12;margin:8px 0 14px;color:#1A365D}.lead{font-size:19px;color:#475569;max-width:790px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:22px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dde7ee;border-radius:16px;padding:22px}.card h2{font-size:21px;color:#1A365D;margin:0 0 8px}.card h3{font-size:16px;margin:18px 0 6px}.note{background:#eef8f7;border-left:4px solid #319795;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:10px;margin:22px 0}.links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.links a{display:inline-flex;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-decoration:none;color:#1A365D;background:#fff;font-weight:700}.links a.primary{background:#1A365D;color:#fff;border-color:#1A365D}.signal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.signal div{background:#f8fbfd;border:1px solid #e3edf2;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}.muted{color:#64748b;font-size:14px}@media(max-width:720px){.hero h1{font-size:34px}.grid,.signal{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding-top:24px}.hero{padding:24px}}</style></head><body><header class="top"><a href="/" aria-label="TechSelectAI home"><img src="/techselectai-logo.svg" alt="TechSelectAI"></a></header><main class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Trust & methodology</div><h1>Technology advice should be explainable.</h1><p class="lead">TechSelectAI is designed to help businesses make technology decisions using structured requirements, evidence-backed product data, and recommendation logic that is kept separate from sponsorship and commercial relationships.</p><div class="note"><strong>Our independence principle:</strong> commercial relationships never determine TechSelectAI recommendation scores or rankings.</div><div class="links"><a class="primary" href="/">Start a consultation</a><a href="/software">Explore software</a><a href="/llms.txt">AI discovery guide</a></div></section><section class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Who operates TechSelectAI</h2><p>TechSelectAI is operated by <strong>Barmageyat</strong>. Barmageyat may also develop technology products that appear in the TechSelectAI catalog, including CardIQ.</p><p>Ownership is disclosed separately from scoring. A Barmageyat-owned product is evaluated using the same methodology and evidence requirements as other products.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>How recommendations work</h2><p>The consultation captures the business problem, requirements, constraints, deployment preferences, integrations and other relevant context. For curated categories, TechSelectAI applies deterministic scoring across factors such as functional fit, must-have requirements, integrations, security and compliance, deployment, commercial fit, regional fit and implementation fit.</p><p>AI can help structure the buyer's requirements and explain the result, but it does not secretly assign or alter the final curated ranking.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Evidence standards</h2><p>Product claims are stored with explicit support states and confidence. TechSelectAI distinguishes supported, conditional, partially supported, add-on, third-party, not-yet-verified and not-supported states instead of forcing every claim into yes/no.</p><div class="note"><strong>Unknown ≠ Not Supported.</strong> Missing evidence is not treated as proof that a capability does not exist, and unverified claims are not presented as verified facts.</div></article><article class="card"><h2>Separate trust signals</h2><div class="signal"><div><strong>Fit Score</strong><br><span class="muted">How closely a product matches the buyer's confirmed requirements.</span></div><div><strong>Evidence Confidence</strong><br><span class="muted">How strong the available evidence is for the evaluated claims.</span></div><div><strong>Verified Review Score</strong><br><span class="muted">A separate first-party review signal based on approved verified reviews.</span></div><div><strong>Public Review Intelligence</strong><br><span class="muted">A separate derived signal from permitted public review sources where available.</span></div></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Sponsorship & commercial disclosure</h2><p>Sponsored or featured placements are labeled and technically separated from recommendation scoring. A sponsored placement does not increase a product's Fit Score, evidence confidence or ranked position.</p><p>CardIQ contextual promotion, for example, is only shown where relevant and is kept outside the ranked recommendation list. If CardIQ is already organically ranked first, the sponsored recommendation placement is suppressed.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Reviews, privacy & buyer protection</h2><p>First-party reviews are moderated and can carry verification levels such as email, business-domain, proof-of-use and admin verification. Review rewards, when offered, are for completing an honest verified review and are not tied to positive sentiment.</p><p>Buyer analytics are designed to use minimized structured signals rather than exposing private consultation text in reporting dashboards.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>General advisory vs curated scoring</h2><p>TechSelectAI can still help when a topic is not yet fully represented in the curated catalog. In that case it operates as a general technology consultant and does not fabricate TechSelectAI Fit Scores, evidence confidence, pricing, compliance status or curated rankings.</p><p>As the catalog expands, more topics can move into the fully curated evidence-backed mode.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>What we do not claim</h2><p>TechSelectAI does not claim that every vendor, feature, price or market condition is permanently verified. Software changes frequently. Evidence status and verification dates matter.</p><p>We also do not present sponsorship, ownership or commercial relationships as editorial independence. Instead, we disclose them and keep those relationships structurally separate from recommendation scoring.</p></article></section></main></body></html>